- **Test case draft format (norms + schema template)**: [epics/templates/tests-ref.json](../../epics/templates/tests-ref.json) (**format_norms**); pipeline [`.cursor/pipelines/test-prep.md`](../pipelines/test-prep.md)
- **Defect report format reference**: [docs/dr-ref](docs/dr-ref)
- **Epic handoff template** (schema **v4**): [epics/templates/epic-ref.json](epics/templates/epic-ref.json) → `epics/<KEY>/<KEY>-ref.json`; **`obligations_proposed[]`**; [docs/epic-obligation-kinds.json](../../docs/epic-obligation-kinds.json); [automation/docs/epic-prep-verify.md](../../automation/docs/epic-prep-verify.md); [`.cursor/pipelines/epic-prep.md`](../pipelines/epic-prep.md)
- **Epic coverage** (schema **v2**): [epics/templates/coverage-ref.json](epics/templates/coverage-ref.json) → `-coverage.json` / `.md`; **`obligations_coverage`**; [docs/coverage-obligation-contract.json](../../docs/coverage-obligation-contract.json); [automation/docs/coverage-verify.md](../../automation/docs/coverage-verify.md); [`.cursor/pipelines/coverage.md`](../pipelines/coverage.md)
- **Epic requirement analysis (v2)**: [epics/templates/analysis-ref.json](epics/templates/analysis-ref.json) schema v2 → `-analysis.json` + gaps-first `-analysis.md`; [docs/analysis-gap-contract.json](../../docs/analysis-gap-contract.json); [automation/docs/analysis-verify.md](../../automation/docs/analysis-verify.md); **`known_issues=yes`** opt-in; **`exploration_suppressed[]`** for discover
- **Epic optional discovery artefact (`TEST-DISCOVER:`)** — structured **only**: [epics/templates/discover-ref.json](epics/templates/discover-ref.json) (**schema v3**) → **`epics/<KEY>/<KEY>-discover.json`** (no `-discover.md` in v1); playbook [`.cursor/pipelines/test-discover.md`](../pipelines/test-discover.md) — **obligation closure**; **Phase 0b/0c** FE gates ([docs/fe-ui-probe-contract.json](../../docs/fe-ui-probe-contract.json): **`fe_ui_sessions`**, **`fe_exploration_waived`**); **`fe_credentials.supplied` ≠ authenticated**; setup depth per [docs/discover-fixture-probes.json](../../docs/discover-fixture-probes.json); verifier checks **`probe_executed`** vs **`fe_ui_sessions`**; **Phase 0 fail → no `-discover.json`**; temp under **`epics/<KEY>/temp/`** then delete; inline FE cred tokens never persisted (no **`temp/`** in JSON). **`TEST-PREP:` SHOULD** load discover and respect **`test_prep_gates.blocked`** / **`discovery_status`**; **must not** use discover for **`[REQUIRES: CRTQA-*]`** when **`crtqa_index_enabled`** is false. Doctrine: [docs/harness-principles.md](../../docs/harness-principles.md) §8. Post-hoc calibration: **`.cursor/calibrate/<KEY>-gold/`** via **`/crtqa-calibrate`** ([docs/calibrate-contract.json](../../docs/calibrate-contract.json))
- **Epic optional precondition authoring (`TEST-PRECON:` v5)** — [epics/templates/precon-ref.json](epics/templates/precon-ref.json) schema v5; **Phase 2b** **`case_outline[]`**, **`session_placeholders`**, **`command_patterns`**; **Phase 4R/4D/4C** **`precon_drill`**; [automation/docs/precon-verify.md](../../automation/docs/precon-verify.md); temp then delete.
- **Epic regression test drafts (`TEST-PREP:` v3.1)** — [epics/templates/tests-ref.json](epics/templates/tests-ref.json) schema v4; default **`crtqa_outline`**; **expansion_policy** in [docs/test-prep-tbd-contract.json](../../docs/test-prep-tbd-contract.json) (one pair per `case_outline` row, not per `ladder_step` line); **`selection_rules_machine`** in [docs/test-verification-classes.json](../../docs/test-verification-classes.json); verifier [automation/docs/test-prep-verify.md](../../automation/docs/test-prep-verify.md) (`plan`/`draft`/`merge`/`tests` + `--plan` on emit)
- **Epic close (`CLOSE:`)** — [epics/templates/close-ref.json](epics/templates/close-ref.json) → `{EpicDir}context/<KEY>-close.json` after archive; playbook [`.cursor/pipelines/close.md`](../pipelines/close.md); contract [docs/close-contract.json](../../docs/close-contract.json); verifier [automation/docs/close-verify.md](../../automation/docs/close-verify.md). **Documentation-only** ladder L0–L4 after **TEST-PREP**; regenerate four root `.md` (`coverage`, `analysis`, `tests`, `precon`); move all JSON to `{EpicDir}context/`; **archive always**; **no** `-close.md`; temp then delete.
- **CLEAN (publish personal / team / public)**: playbook [`.cursor/pipelines/clean.md`](../pipelines/clean.md) (**`CLEAN:`**, **`personal` branch only**); contract [docs/clean-contract.json](../../docs/clean-contract.json); tier matrix [docs/clean-publish-tier-matrix.json](../../docs/clean-publish-tier-matrix.json); team T1 templates [docs/clean-entry-templates/](../../docs/clean-entry-templates/); verifier [automation/tools/clean_verify.py](../../automation/tools/clean_verify.py) (`semver_next --json`, `public_remote` after U4b); public style [docs/clean-public-style.md](../../docs/clean-public-style.md); ephemeral **`automation/temp/clean/`** then delete

Align new test case drafts with [epics/templates/tests-ref.json](../../epics/templates/tests-ref.json) / **dr-ref** unless the task defines a different format. Epic Smart Checklist drafts follow **coverage.md**. Epic regression bundles follow **test-prep.md** after coverage exists.

**JSON inspection:** Agents **MUST** use **`jq`** per [automation/docs/jq.md](../../automation/docs/jq.md) before loading large epic or harness `*.json` into context (see [jq-json.mdc](jq-json.mdc)).

## Automation folder (`automation/`)

Manual **Python tests and tools** (not “workspace automation”). Tool docs: [automation/docs/](automation/docs/) (e.g. Yogi). Agent playbooks: [`.cursor/pipelines/`](../pipelines/).

- **Temporary / agent scratch**: [automation/temp/](automation/temp/) — short-lived only; promote outcomes to proper docs or handoff.

